---
const vaultUrl = 'https://github.com/reneweteling/loft-app/tree/main/vault/20-Setup';
const readmeUrl = 'https://github.com/reneweteling/loft-app#readme';
---

<section id="setup">
  <div class="section-inner">
    <p class="section-label">Setup</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading">Ready in minutes.</h2>

    <div class="setup-card">
      <!-- Left accent stripe -->
      <div class="stripe" aria-hidden="true"></div>

      <div class="card-content">
        <p>
          You need an S3 bucket with lifecycle rules for the TTL panes, and a narrow IAM policy
          scoped to that bucket. The setup guides walk through everything — bucket creation,
          lifecycle rules, CORS, and the exact policy JSON.
        </p>

        <div class="link-row">
          <a class="btn-outline" href={vaultUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <path d="M7 1h6v6M13 1 6 8M4 3H2a1 1 0 00-1 1v8a1 1 0 001 1h8a1 1 0 001-1v-2"/>
            </svg>
            Setup guide
          </a>
          <a class="btn-outline btn-dim" href={readmeUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 14 14" fill="none" stroke="currentColor"
              stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
              <rect x="1" y="1" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/>
              <path d="M4 4h6M4 7h6M4 10h4"/>
            </svg>
            README on GitHub
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .setup-card {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    overflow: hidden;
    display: flex;
    position: relative;
  }

  .setup-card::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(14, 165, 233, 0.04) 0%, transparent 50%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }

  .stripe {
    width: 4px;
    flex-shrink: 0;
    background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--teal), var(--mid-blue));
  }

  .card-content {
    padding: 2rem 2rem 2rem 1.75rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
  }

  .card-content p {
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    max-width: 600px;
  }

  .link-row {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.75rem;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }

  .btn-dim {
    border-color: var(--border);
    color: var(--text-muted);
  }

  .btn-dim:hover {
    background: var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
</style>
